      "value": "I've reported the same issue here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/sdk-3106-beta3-eye-gaze-mode-set-to-both-halves-tracking-movement\n\nEye movement seems approximately halved compared to non-face tracking modes.",
